{notes}

Enter your MitID User ID. Each sync is one MitID login: data since the last sync is fetched and the KMD access (valid ~1 hour) is discarded immediately and never stored. The integration does not poll KMD in the background.

After Submit: add the "Fjernvarme (KMD Easy Energy): Dashboard" card to a dashboard and press 🚀 Gem & Start MitID-synkronisering there. No MitID login happens in this dialog.
